  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported five primary/reference Load metadata queries with complete matching XML IntelliSense, LoadCase/ILoadCase models and documented enums. Preserved Boolean primary success versus integral counts, qualified bounded ID arrays, positive IDs, exact titles and engineering types. Retained single-pass ordered snapshots, independent editable records and shared lifecycle/thread/reentrancy guards without native changes. See the load-case metadata guide for contracts and validation limits.",
